{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "75d37888-c5c1-44ad-ad13-06b850c58fb1",
    "name": "MH - Recepción DTE Mock",
    "description": "Colección para probar la autenticación simulada y la recepción de DTE del mock local. La petición de recepción requiere un documento JWS; sustituye la variable documentoJws por el JWS de tu DTE firmado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8085",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "documentoJws",
      "value": "eyJhbGciOiJub25lIn0.eyJpZGVudGlmaWNhY2lvbiI6eyJ0aXBvRHRlIjoiMDEiLCJjb2RpZ29HZW5lcmFjaW9uIjoiMDAwMDAwMDAtMDAwMC00MDAwLTgwMDAtMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwIn0sImVtaXNvciI6eyJuaXQiOiIwNjE0LTI4MDM5MC0xMTItMSJ9fQ.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "nitEmisor",
      "value": "06142803901121",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdte",
      "value": "01",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "codigoGeneracion",
      "value": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "documentoJwsAnulacion",
      "value": "eyJhbGciOiJub25lIn0.eyJpZGVudGlmaWNhY2lvbiI6eyJ2ZXJzaW9uIjozLCJhbWJpZW50ZSI6IjAwIiwiY29kaWdvR2VuZXJhY2lvbiI6IkNGODlCMjFFLTQyNjgtNDcxMS04MzJELThBNTQ4NjZCMTc2MyJ9fQ.",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "user",
              "value": "{{user}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "pwd",
              "value": "{{pwd}}",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/seguridad/auth",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "seguridad",
            "auth"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Envía usuario y contraseña como formulario. Guarda automáticamente el token de la respuesta para la petición de recepción."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Autenticación responde HTTP 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const response = pm.response.json();",
              "if (response.body && response.body.token) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', response.body.token);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Recepción DTE",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"ambiente\": \"00\",\n  \"idEnvio\": 1,\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"tipoDte\": \"01\",\n  \"documento\": \"{{documentoJws}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/fesv/recepciondte",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "fesv",
            "recepciondte"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Envía el wrapper de recepción con Authorization Bearer. El JWS de ejemplo solo permite comprobar desempaquetado y será rechazado por no incluir la estructura DTE completa. Sustituye documentoJws por un JWS cuyo payload cumpla el schema correspondiente."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Respuesta de recepción HTTP 200 o 400', function () {",
              "    pm.expect([200, 400]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Anulación DTE",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"ambiente\": \"00\",\n  \"idEnvio\": 1,\n  \"version\": 3,\n  \"documento\": \"{{documentoJwsAnulacion}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/fesv/anulardte",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "fesv",
            "anulardte"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Envía el sobre de anulación con Authorization Bearer. El payload JWS debe cumplir v3/invalidacion-schema-v3.json. El JWS de ejemplo solo permite comprobar desempaquetado y será rechazado por no incluir el evento completo. Sustituye documentoJwsAnulacion por un JWS cuyo payload sea el evento de invalidación firmado."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Respuesta de anulación HTTP 200 o 400', function () {",
              "    pm.expect([200, 400]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Consulta DTE",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "User-Agent",
            "value": "PostmanRuntime/7.45.0"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nitEmisor\": \"{{nitEmisor}}\",\n  \"tdte\": \"{{tdte}}\",\n  \"codigoGeneracion\": \"{{codigoGeneracion}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/fesv/recepcion/consultadte",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "fesv",
            "recepcion",
            "consultadte"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Consulta por NIT del emisor, tipo de DTE y código de generación. El User-Agent es obligatorio. Usa los valores de variables que coincidan con los incluidos en el payload JWS."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Consulta responde con DTE o no encontrado', function () {",
              "    pm.expect([200, 400]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
